  "card": "Write idiomatic German, not translated English. Keep the finite verb second in main clauses and last in subordinate clauses, and avoid English-style participle chains. Address the player character with 'du' unless the profile sets 'Sie'; NPCs choose du or Sie by rank, age and closeness and keep that choice. Use one style of German quotation marks consistently. Avoid stock beats (einen Moment lang) and 'nicht X, sondern Y' descriptions. Write days and small numbers in words and never show tracker values."
